<h2 id="job-change">Job Change Quest</h2>
<Callout title="Speak with Lorelei Sorin in the Orphanage">
  <p>Requirement: <strong>Orphan Job Level 10</strong>. Start at <strong>va_orpha 376, 129</strong>.</p>
  <ol>
    <li>Choose the cold-hearted answer to earn Lorelei's trust.</li>
    <li>Touch the wisp in the same room at <strong>va_orpha 391, 133</strong> to enter the hidden chamber.</li>
    <li>Find <strong>Serin</strong> in the crypt at <strong>que_trck01 197, 198</strong> and win her number-guessing game.</li>
  </ol>
  <div class="trickster-quest-screenshots" aria-label="Trickster job change characters">
    <figure><img src={withBase('images/classes/trickster-job-change-lorelei.png')} alt="Cropped Refuge screenshot of Lorelei Sorin" width="140" height="150" loading="lazy" /><figcaption>Lorelei Sorin starts the job quest in the Orphanage.</figcaption></figure>
    <figure><img src={withBase('images/classes/trickster-job-change-wisp.png')} alt="Cropped Refuge screenshot of the Wisp" width="90" height="100" loading="lazy" /><figcaption>Touch the Wisp in Lorelei's room to open the hidden chamber.</figcaption></figure>
    <figure><img src={withBase('images/classes/trickster-job-change-serin.png')} alt="Cropped Refuge screenshot of Trickster Serin" width="160" height="230" loading="lazy" /><figcaption>Find Trickster Serin in the crypt and win her number-guessing game.</figcaption></figure>
  </div>
  <p>Reward: the Trickster job and a <strong>Black Scythe</strong>.</p>
</Callout>

<h2 id="core-gameplay">Core Gameplay & Skills</h2>
<p>Trickster deals close-range damage with scythes, critical attacks, Fire skills, and life leech. Its defensive skills help sustain longer fights, while low defenses, high SP costs, and cooldowns need attention.</p>
<p>Equip a <strong>scythe</strong>. STR and LUK are the class's listed main stats. Use short attack rotations and life leech to sustain yourself, while watching your SP and cooldowns.</p>
<ul>
  <li><SkillIcon icon="LK_SPIRALPIERCE" /><strong>Scythe Reap:</strong> the opener for Trickster's main combo. It deals multiple hits and grants <strong>Combo Ready</strong>.</li>
  <li><SkillIcon icon="KN_PIERCE" /><strong>Sweeping Slash:</strong> cast it after Scythe Reap while <strong>Combo Ready</strong> is active. Without it, Sweeping Slash deals reduced damage.</li>
  <li><SkillIcon icon="RK_IGNITIONBREAK" /><strong>Hellraiser:</strong> a Fire attack around you with a long cooldown. It activates <strong>Finisher Ready</strong>.</li>
  <li><SkillIcon icon="SA_FLAMELAUNCHER" /><strong>Burning Scythe:</strong> endows your weapon with Fire for its duration.</li>
  <li><SkillIcon icon="LK_PARRYING" /><strong>Shadow Parry:</strong> blocks physical hits while using a scythe, with a brief pause after a successful block.</li>
  <li><SkillIcon icon="SL_KAITE" /><strong>Mirror Image:</strong> reflects eligible targeted magic, but increases incoming physical damage. Boss magic cannot be reflected.</li>
</ul>
<p>Check current costs and prerequisites in the <a href="https://rtm-database.pages.dev/skills.html" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Refuge skills database ↗</a>. The early allocation and skill-tree image are community references, not independently tested recommendations.</p>

<h3>Early leveling (levels 1–100)</h3>
<p>Use this stat allocation example as a guide:</p>
<ol class="trickster-stat-order">
  <li>49 STR/LUK</li>
  <li>20 VIT/INT</li>
  <li>70 STR/LUK</li>
  <li>40 VIT/INT</li>
  <li>90 LUK</li>
</ol>
<p>Raise both STR and LUK to 49 before moving on to the later targets. Add VIT and INT as needed for survivability and SP while leveling.</p>
<p>It lists this skill order for Trickster:</p>
<ol class="trickster-skill-order">
  <li><SkillIcon icon="LK_SPIRALPIERCE" />Unlock Scythe Reap and <SkillIcon icon="KN_PIERCE" />Sweeping Slash.</li>
  <li><SkillIcon icon="PR_MACEMASTERY" />Max Scythe Mastery.</li>
  <li><SkillIcon icon="MG_SRECOVERY" />Raise Increase SP Recovery to level 5.</li>
  <li><SkillIcon icon="KN_PIERCE" />Max Sweeping Slash.</li>
  <li><SkillIcon icon="SN_SIGHT" />Max True Sight.</li>
  <li><SkillIcon icon="MG_SRECOVERY" />Max Increase SP Recovery.</li>
  <li><SkillIcon icon="LK_PARRYING" />Max Shadow Parry.</li>
  <li><SkillIcon icon="SA_FLAMELAUNCHER" />Max Burning Scythe to endow your weapon with Fire; if you will not use it for that, spend those points leveling <SkillIcon icon="RK_IGNITIONBREAK" />Hellraiser instead.</li>
  <li><SkillIcon icon="LK_SPIRALPIERCE" />Max Scythe Reap.</li>
</ol>
<figure class="trickster-build-image">
  <img src={withBase('images/classes/trickster-skill-tree.png')} alt="Basic Trickster skill tree shown in the leveling spreadsheet" width="562" height="403" loading="lazy" />
  <figcaption>Basic Trickster skill tree from Phawkes' community leveling reference.</figcaption>
</figure>

<h2 id="how-to-play">How to Play</h2>
<ol>
  <li>Use <SkillIcon icon="LK_SPIRALPIERCE" />Scythe Reap to activate <strong>Combo Ready</strong>, then follow with <SkillIcon icon="KN_PIERCE" />Sweeping Slash. Casting Sweeping Slash without <strong>Combo Ready</strong> reduces its damage.</li>
  <li><SkillIcon icon="RK_IGNITIONBREAK" />Hellraiser has a long cooldown, but activates <strong>Finisher Ready</strong>, letting Sweeping Slash hit three times instead of two.</li>
  <li>Use life-leeching attacks to recover while dealing damage. Watch SP and cooldowns during longer fights.</li>
  <li><SkillIcon icon="LK_PARRYING" />Use Shadow Parry against physical attacks. <SkillIcon icon="SL_KAITE" />Mirror Image can reflect eligible magic, but makes physical hits much more dangerous while active.</li>
</ol>
<p>This is a starting overview, not a tested skill rotation. Check skill costs and effects in the <a href="https://rtm-database.pages.dev/skills.html" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Refuge skills database ↗</a>.</p>

<h2 id="progress-gear">Progress Gear</h2>
<p>Serin rewards the job change with a <strong>Black Scythe</strong>. Bring your Exchange Voucher to Ornstein in the smithy to receive a <strong>Scythe of the Orphan</strong>. Further gear milestones and recommendations are still being reviewed.</p>

<h2 id="next-step">Next Step</h2>
<p>Reach <strong>Trickster Job Level 70</strong> to advance to <a href={withBase('classes/revenant/')}>Revenant</a>. Its job-change walkthrough is WIP.</p>
